{
  "_comment": "ERC-7201 namespaces of the token kinds (spec §1.4, §10.4): root, then each field's namespace slot, its slot inside a mapping's value or struct, and its byte in that word. Pinned by test/v2/Layout.t.sol test_namespaceRootsAndOffsetsArePinned (a write through the source's accessor, then vm.load); a mapping field is read at the keys the test names. `pqz` and `zether` (plan T19c, no-decryption-oracle spec §4.4, §4.7; read by ua-rs as a vector) add per field `widths` (bytes of the value) and `encodings` (solc's): `inplace` = the value at `bytes` of the word; `bytes` = solc dynamic bytes at that word (length < 32: data left-aligned, low byte 2·length; else the word 2·length + 1 and the data from word keccak256(slot)); `mapping` = a mapping member of a struct: the member's slot is root + slot, keyed by the outer key, + inner, and the value of key k sits at keccak256(k ‖ that slot). Keys: U = 0xcafe…a11a, V = 0xbeef…b22b (NamespaceProbeIds), abi-encoded as 32-byte words. acct[U][7].accWords is uint256[PQZ_ACC_WORDS] from inner 4 on (the length per set: src/pqz/PqzSet.sol PQZ_ACC_WORDS; [0] and [1] pinned), each word not() of the packed stream; the pending word's packing blob(160) ‖ uOff(16) ‖ vOff(16) ‖ block(64) is PqzCore's, not the compiler's. Group 3g T52 (pqz-key-versions spec §3.1, KV-6): `scaas.pqz`'s `acct` is keyed `(ua, key version)`, so its rows read acct[U][7] (`keyVersions`: the version key hashed after the field's first key, keccak256(7 ‖ keccak256(U ‖ root + 8)), 0 = none); the account lost `sendCounter` (accHash inner 3 -> 2, pending 4 -> 3, accWords 5 -> 4), now `sendCounter[U]` at slot 12, one per UA. Group 3f (PQZ verifier mode spec §3, §4.4): `pqzVerifyMode` at byte 22 of slot 0 (beside `pqz` and the two modes, so a PRECOMPILE debit reads no new slot), the verifier state appended at slots 13-18 (`pqzVerifierUA`, `pqzVerifierShape`, then `pqzVerifierEpoch` ‖ `pqzVerifierFixed` ‖ `noticePeriod` ‖ `eta` in slot 15, `pqzPendingVerifier`, `pqzProposer`, `pqzProposerGeneration`); every earlier row unchanged. Group 3h T58 (pqz-proof-path spec §2.2, §6; CTR-PQZ-33 draft): the account's `lastDebit` (uint64) in the slot 3g's `sendCounter` left (inner 2; accHash 2 -> 3, pending 3 -> 4, accWords 4 -> 5), `debitRec[U][7]` (the UA, then the debit's counter as the second key, `keyVersions` 7) appended at slot 19: `w0` inner 0, `w1` inner 1; every other row unchanged. Group 3h T60 (pqz-proof-path spec §4.1, C8): `proofStore` at byte 23 of slot 0, beside `pqzVerifyMode` (byte 22). Plan T83 (owner 2026-11-09): `payRecords` = `scaas.pay.records`, `records` a mapping(bytes32 payNo => PayRecord[]) at slot 0: `records[V].length` at keccak256(V ‖ root + 0); record i from keccak256(that slot) + 2·i (`encodings` `array`, `inner` the word in the record): `to` the first word, `amount` bytes 0-23 and `blockNumber` bytes 24-31 of the second; rows read records 0 and 1 (`index`).",
